      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Darcie thinks libraries are very special. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " She said, “It helps them be themselves in the library.” Her favourite part of helping is seeing other children enjoy reading."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Recently, Darcie won the School Library Association’s Pupil Library Assistant of the Year award for primary school children. She was very shocked but also "
